# No environment variables are required by the marketing site today.
#
# Add only documented, value-free placeholders here when the implementation
# introduces a real requirement. Keep secrets in .env.local and never prefix a
# secret with NEXT_PUBLIC_, because Next.js exposes those values to browsers.

# Optional local comparison tool. Leave blank for release-like previews.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SHOW_STYLE_SWITCHER=
